     顶部大柔光箱\nrim light from behind left      左后轮廓光\nlow-key lighting, hard shadow   低调硬光/强反差\nsoft morning window light       清晨窗侧光\neven illumination, no shadow    均匀无影（电商白底）\n\n这套词比喂光照图更可控。\n光照图预设（光照图预设/）仍然能用，\n但要多接一条参考链，先跑通文字版再说。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [430, 300], "pos": [-1262.5203857421875, 355.8707275390625], "id": 160, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["【材质词 · 复制粘贴到 Material: 后面】\n\nbrushed anodized aluminium      拉丝阳极氧化铝\nmatte ABS plastic               哑光 ABS\npolished stainless steel        镜面不锈钢\npowder-coated matte black       哑光黑喷粉\nfrosted translucent plastic     磨砂半透 PC\nsoft-touch rubberized coating   软触橡胶涂层\nwalnut wood                     胡桃木\nstained ash wood               染色白蜡木\nmatte ceramic                   哑光陶瓷\nwoven fabric / linen            织布 / 亚麻\nsandblasted aluminium           喷砂铝\nglossy injection-moulded plastic 亮面注塑"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [430, 340], "pos": [-1712.53564453125, 324.2333984375], "id": 150, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [7], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "size": [430, 240], "pos": [-801.1340942382812, 416.991455078125], "widgets_values": ["Render this hand-drawn pencil sketch as a photorealistic product photo. Material: brushed anodized aluminium and little blue plastic. Lighting: soft three-point studio lighting, gentle shadow. Clean neutral background, sharp focus, studio product photography."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 5, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 80, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "title": "② 只改这一句（材质 